device d  ( ppnw    )  dif_PD_P_NW       PSD     NW      netlist model ppnw
device d  ( nppw33  )  dif_PD_N_PW33     PW      NSD     netlist model nppw33
device d  ( nppwi33 )  dif_PD_N_PW_DNW33 PW      NSD     netlist model nppwi33
device d  ( ppnw33  )  dif_PD_P_NW33     PSD     NW      netlist model ppnw33
